      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROAD TO IBROX (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at Gosford over 388m behind Laurie's Rupee (22.94) in a Grade 4/5. Can discover winning form. UNLEASH SHIRLEY (1) ran below best last time finishing sixth (30.31) over 515m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MAEVE BABY (2) has mixed form recently, finishing eighth (23.53) in a Grade 4/5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Well placed here and can atone this time. SKINNY MARIE (8) was out of placings last time (23.45) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 10 lengths. Has already won three times from this draw.",
